<td id="S5.T3.2.1.7.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_b ltx_border_r">(S. <a href="#S3.SS2.SSS2" title="3.2.2 Model-Triggered Streaming RAG ‣ 3.2 Streaming RAG ‣ 3 Methodology ‣ Stream RAG: Instant and Accurate SpokenDialogue Systems with Streaming Tool Usage" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3.2.2</span></a>)</td>
<td id="S5.T3.2.1.7.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_b ltx_border_r">P90</td>
